      "description": "Generative AI & Enterprise LLM Architecture</strong> is a comprehensive masterclass engineered for senior developers, architects, and technical leaders who want to build secure, scalable, and hallucination-free AI applications.</p>\n<h3>Key Learning Outcomes:</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>RAG Pipeline Design:</strong> Build robust Retrieval-Augmented Generation architectures using vector stores (pgvector/Qdrant) and chunking strategies.</li>\n  <li><strong>Enterprise Security & Safety:</strong> Implement guardrails against prompt injection, jailbreaks, data leakage, and ungrounded hallucinations.</li>\n  <li><strong>Model Evaluation & Fine-Tuning:</strong> Evaluate model outputs programmatically using Ragas, BLEU, and LLM-as-a-Judge frameworks.</li>\n  <li><strong>Production Deployment:</strong> Scale LLM endpoints using asynchronous worker queues, response streaming (SSE), and intelligent semantic caching.</li>\n",
