E_SELECT\",\"marks\":2,\"options\":[\"GitHub\",\"GitLab\",\"Bitbucket\",\"Jira\"],\"correctAnswer\":[\"GitHub\",\"GitLab\",\"Bitbucket\"]},{\"questionText\":\"Which of the following are essential components of RAG architecture?\",\"questionType\":\"MULTIPLE_SELECT\",\"marks\":2,\"options\":[\"Embeddings\",\"Vector Index\",\"LLM\",\"CSS\"],\"correctAnswer\":[\"Embeddings\",\"Vector Index\",\"LLM\"]},{\"questionText\":\"What does API stand for?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Application Programming Interface\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does SQL stand for?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Structured Query Language\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does URL stand for?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Uniform Resource Locator\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does CSS stand for?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Cascading Style Sheets\"},{\"questionText\":\"What is the capital of France?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Paris\"},{\"questionText\":\"What command is used to clone a Git repository?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"git clone\"},{\"questionText\":\"What command is used to install npm dependencies?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"npm install\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does CPU stand for?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Central Processing Unit\"},{\"questionText\":\"What keyword is used to declare a constant in JavaScript?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"const\"},{\"questionText\":\"What protocol encrypts web communication over port 443?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"HTTPS\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does RAM stand for?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Random Access Memory\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does SDK stand for?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Software Development Kit\"},{\"questionText\":\"What command initializes a new Git repository?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"git init\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does DOM stand for in web browsers?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Document Object Model\"},{\"questionText\":\"What is the standard port for HTTPS connections?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"443\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does DNS stand for in networking?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Domain Name System\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does IP stand for in IP address?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Internet Protocol\"},{\"questionText\":\"What command builds a Docker image from a Dockerfile?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"docker build\"},{\"questionText\":\"What format does JSON use for data exchange?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"Text\"},{\"questionText\":\"What keyword handles exceptions in Python try blocks?\",\"questionType\":\"SHORT_ANSWER\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"except\"}]}",
