\"def\",\"procedure\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"def\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does JSON stand for?\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ\",\"marks\":2,\"options\":[\"JavaScript Object Notation\",\"Java Server Object Network\",\"JavaScript Syntax Oriented Node\",\"Java Structured Object Naming\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"JavaScript Object Notation\"},{\"questionText\":\"Which data structure operates on LIFO (Last In First Out)?\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ\",\"marks\":2,\"options\":[\"Queue\",\"Stack\",\"LinkedList\",\"Heap\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"Stack\"},{\"questionText\":\"What HTTP method is typically used to create a new resource?\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ\",\"marks\":2,\"options\":[\"GET\",\"POST\",\"PUT\",\"DELETE\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"POST\"},{\"questionText\":\"Which component in Docker packages an application and its dependencies?\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ\",\"marks\":2,\"options\":[\"Container\",\"Volume\",\"Network\",\"Swarm\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"Container\"},{\"questionText\":\"In React\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ\",\"marks\":2,\"options\":[\"MCQ\",\"useState\",\"useEffect\",\"useContext\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"useReducer\"},{\"questionText\":\"Which SQL clause is used to filter aggregated records?\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ\",\"marks\":2,\"options\":[\"WHERE\",\"HAVING\",\"GROUP BY\",\"ORDER BY\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"HAVING\"},{\"questionText\":\"What does REST stand for in web API architecture?\",\"questionType\":\"MCQ\",\"marks\":2,\"options\":[\"Representational State Transfer\",\"Remote Execution System Tech\",\"Reliable Storage Technology\",\"Response Endpoint Transfer\"],\"correctAnswer\":\"Representational State Transfer\"},{\"questionText\":\"CSS is used to structure content on a webpage.\",\"questionType\":\"TRUE_FALSE\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"False\"},{\"questionText\":\"Python is a statically typed programming language.\",\"questionType\":\"TRUE_FALSE\",\"marks\":2,\"correctAnswer\":\"False\"},{\"questionText\":\"HTTP is a stateless protocol.\",\"questionType\":\"T